# Service source — never served, in either of the two ways this can be enforced.
#
# The vhost <Directory> block in apache-snippet.conf denies this too, and that
# is the belt to this pair of braces. Found the hard way during the T26b deploy
# rehearsal: server/ was the one source directory protected *only* by the vhost,
# the vhost snippet is installed by hand as a separate step, and between the
# branch landing on the box and that step happening, incisor.py was served with
# a 200 while docs/, tests/ and tools/ were correctly 403.
#
# A directory guarded by one mechanism is guarded until someone changes that
# mechanism, or has not yet added it.
Require all denied
